# The showcase pass: the Workshop images, taken on the owner's photographic colony.
#
# ScreenshotStudio supplies the fixture "nelim-zen-meadow-studio" (paused, Core and the five DLC, staged
# through PickleTools). Only 15-publication-shots.feature asks for it, and it is skipped in every other pass,
# so this map is only for that feature:
#   Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod ManyHappyReturns -DepMap wsl-deps.studio.map -Language English -Filter 15-publication-shots.feature
# Run it in English: the Workshop page is English.
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode     path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.inspecttabs        path:PickleTools/InspectTabs/Mod
